-- SavedQuery — a reusable, composable query (can reference other queries
-- via $ref).
--
-- Phase 3b of the system-entities sweep — see
-- workstreams/ts-elimination/briefs/phase-3b-system-entities-small-batch.md.
-- Identity (label / description) is registered by defineSystemEntity on
-- the TS side; only the structural type lives here.
--
-- TODO: the `query` field's `{}` (empty record) shape is preserved
-- bug-compatibly from the pre-3b TS literal. AGENTS.md flags
-- `type: {$record: {fields: []}}` as a documented anti-pattern: the
-- editor / inference reads an empty-record literal as the *actual*
-- declared return shape, not as a placeholder. The real schema for
-- query bodies is out of scope for Phase 3b and lands when SavedQuery
-- gets a designed body type (JSON Logic AST + reference resolution
-- semantics). Until then this empty-record shape preserves the
-- existing runtime behavior. Once the real schema lands, update both
-- this .fenel file and the system-entities-load.test.ts expectations
-- together.

-- NAMING IS NOT A FIELD HERE (2026-09-18, Rom). A value's human name is a
-- `Labelable` instance and its prose a `Describable` one — the same mechanism
-- every other nameable thing in the typespace uses, and the one the New Value
-- modal was ALREADY authoring (`repString(reps(), "Labelable", "label")`). Two
-- `String` fields here made naming MANDATORY: `String` is not erasable, so
-- `validationRecordRows` marks them required and refuses `""`. A value has an
-- id; a name is something you may or may not have given it.
--
-- `saved_queries.name` / `.description` survive as COLUMNS, demoted to a
-- denormalised mirror of those instances that ORDER BY and ILIKE search read —
-- the `$opaque` repr discipline applied to storage: the instance is the
-- definition, the column is the efficient index. They are nullable, and an
-- unnamed value writes NULL rather than a sentinel empty string.

@entity
@codeName "saved_query"
@label "Saved Query"
@description "A reusable, composable query — can reference other queries via $ref"
SavedQuery = SavedQuery slug: String query: {}
